    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95139" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοροδ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>does with garlic</i>, prop. of game-cocks <i>which
				were primed with garlic</i> before fighting, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάσκων φιλεῖν μ᾽ ἐσκορόδισας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					946
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσκοροδις μένος</span>
			<i>primed with garlic</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				494
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ach.</u>
				166
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>flavour with garlic</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθαλα ποιήσας . . κἀσκοροδισμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					17.13
				</span></i>
			.</div>
